        <h1 itemprop="headline">The Libra alternative for iOS: no ads, no account.</h1>
        <p itemprop="description">Libra is a genuinely useful tracker with a smooth trend line, and it deserves credit for it. If you are on iOS and want the same calm trend idea without ads, cloud sync, or a Pro subscription, here is how WeekScale compares.</p>
