            <section class="prose-section" id="which-to-choose">
                <h2>Which should you choose?</h2>
                <p>Choose Libra if you rely on multi-metric tracking, cloud sync, or scale integrations, or if you are happy with a free, ad-supported app. Choose WeekScale if you want a simpler weight-only tracker with no ads, no account, and no recurring price.</p>
                <p>If your main concern is where your weight data goes, the <a class="inline-link" href="/private-weight-tracker">local-first guide</a> explains the tradeoffs in detail.</p>
